Meet Grey Wolf, an all-in-one guitar amplifier built to bring the essential tools of a guitarist together in one place.

Main Features:

Integrated Amplifier, Drive and Noise Gate

Apex EQF-2 inspired Parametric EQ with Bass, Mid and Treble controls

Built-in Cabinet Simulation with external cabinet support

NAM Profile Loading – Use your favorite Clean, Crunch or High-Gain amp profiles

Doubler / Twin Tracker for wider, fuller guitar tones

Transpose for changing tuning without physically retuning your guitar

Room Effect for adding natural room ambience

Grey Wolf is designed to be a practical, versatile amp solution without the need for multiple additional plugins.

Hope you enjoy playing with it!

Guitarists, have fun!
